MalaCards\"}\nproperty_value: IAO:0000233 \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9826\" xsd:anyURI\nproperty_value: IAO:0006012 \"2026-03-01\" xsd:string\n\n","exit":0,"description":"Find all references to MONDO:0008549","truncated":false},"title":"Find all references to MONDO:0008549","time":{"start":1778900606479,"end":1778900606481}},"id":"prt_e2ebd1d5e001FCTGScF7xcHEW1","sessionID":"ses_1d14305deffe8PMIAPUXd84qw2","messageID":"msg_e2ebd1510001zRvHvBrGoymkbK"}}
