{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778900941253,"sessionID":"ses_1d14305deffe8PMIAPUXd84qw2","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"functions.write:41","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/home/runner/work/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md","content":"## Summary\nThis PR obsoletes MONDO:0008549 (thoracic dysostosis, isolated) and merges its content into MONDO:0979242 (short-rib thoracic dysplasia 22 without polydactyly), in response to issue #9826 and the OMIM merge of 187750 → 621260.\n\n## Changes\n- **MONDO:0008549** is now marked `obsolete` with:\n  - `name: obsolete thoracic dysostosis, isolated`\n  - `is_obsolete: true`\n  - `replaced_by: MONDO:0979242`\n  - `property_value: IAO:0000231 MONDO:TermsMerged`\n  - `property_value: IAO:0000233 \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9826\" xsd:anyURI`\n  - All logical axioms, definition, synonyms, xrefs, subsets, and obsoletion scheduling metadata removed.\n- **MONDO:0979242** (surviving term) now includes:\n  - Transferred synonym: `synonym: \"thoracic dysostosis, isolated\" EXACT [OMIM:187750]`\n  - Transferred xrefs: `OMIM:187750` (as `MONDO:equivalentObsolete`), `MESH:C566063` (as `MONDO:equivalentTo`)\n  - Transferred tracker link: `property_value: IAO:0000233 ...`\n  - Removed redundant `is_a: MONDO:0003847 ! hereditary disease`, as the surviving term already has a more specific parent `is_a: MONDO:0018770 ! Jeune syndrome` from which hereditary disease is inferred.\n  - Removed obsoletion-tracking metadata (`subset: obsoletion_candidate` and `IAO:0006012` scheduled-obsoletion date) that were inadvertently transferred during the merge.\n\n## Checklist (completed)\n- [x] Owltools `--obsolete-replace` run successfully.\n- [x] File normalized with `make NORM`.\n- [x] Obsoleted stanza cleaned to only allowed lines (id, name, IAO:0000231, IAO:0000233, is_obsolete, replaced_by).\n- [x] Surviving stanza cleaned of obsoletion-tracking metadata.\n- [x] Synonym evidence updated; no `[MONDO:0008549]` citations remain on the surviving term.\n- [x] Redundant `is_a` removed.\n- [x] No other terms reference the obsoleted ID (confirmed via grep).\n- [x] `alt_id` checks pass.\n- [x] No duplicate synonyms on the surviving term.\n- [x] Robot syntax conversion passes.\n- [x] All targeted QC SPARQL checks pass with 0 violations:\n  - `qc-proxy-merge-missing-preferred`\n  - `qc-misused-replaced-by`\n  - `qc-obsoletion-reason`\n  - `qc-deprecated-class-reference`\n  - `qc-xref-without-precision`\n  - `qc-duplicate-exact-synonym-no-abbrev`\n\n## Rationale\nThis merge aligns MONDO with the OMIM entry merge (OMIM:187750 → OMIM:621260). The surviving term, MONDO:0979242, is the conceptually equivalent modern term, and all meaningful metadata from the obsolete term was migrated or cleaned up per MONDO merge guidelines."},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/home/runner/work/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"PR_COMMENTS.md","time":{"start":1778900941247,"end":1778900941251}},"id":"prt_e2ec22cf6001SgcNFOPgmVgSm2","sessionID":"ses_1d14305deffe8PMIAPUXd84qw2","messageID":"msg_e2ec22832001eSKr4Kd7pWV0bs"}}
